course: dictionary
lesson: 6807
title: Old words and kind words
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are part of a name. In «Oriental fire-bellied toads are popular pets, and hands must be washed after touching them», Oriental is part of the name of a kind of toad, so it tells you which type of toad you mean.
explain: Oriental means from or to do with the countries of East Asia, like China, Japan and Korea. You will also see it in names like "oriental rug". It is an old-fashioned word, and using it to describe people can be rude.
explain: When you talk about people today, choose a kinder, more exact word: "Asian", "East Asian", or the country, such as "Chinese" or "Korean". Ask yourself: am I talking about a thing or an animal, or about a person? That helps you choose the right word.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: «Oriental» means from or to do with the countries of East Asia, like China, Japan and Korea.
fact: «Oriental» is old-fashioned, and describing people as Oriental can be offensive.
fact: For people, say «Asian», «East Asian», or the country, such as «Chinese» or «Korean».
fact: Oriental is often used in fixed names, like «oriental rug» or «Oriental Shorthair» (a cat breed).
exercise: «Oriental fire-bellied toads are popular pets.» What is Oriental doing in this sentence? | It means a fast, jumping animal | It means the toads are very old | *It tells you which kind of toad, as part of its name | It means the toads are sleepy
exercise: Oriental means from or to do with which places? | *The countries of East Asia, like China, Japan and Korea | The countries of South America | The top of a mountain | The sea near a beach
exercise: Which word is the kind, modern choice for describing a person from Korea? | Ancient | *Korean | Oriental | Mid
test: Oriental is an old-fashioned word, so for a person from Japan, which is the better choice? | Mid | Curt | *Japanese | Oriental, because it sounds grand
test: In the names «oriental rug» and «Oriental Shorthair», what kind of word is Oriental? | A verb meaning to walk slowly | A word for a person | A word meaning very old | *A part of a name, used for things and animals
exam: The sentence «Oriental fire-bellied toads are popular pets, and hands must be washed after touching them.» tells you what to do after touching the toads. What is it? | Wear gloves for a week | Give them a bath | *Wash your hands | Feed them at night
